// Generated Israel faction names and tooltips.

INI:FactionIsrael
"Israel"
END

SIDE:Israel
"Israel"
END

TOOLTIP:BioStrategyLong_Israel
"More armour. More sensors. Bring the crew home. Lead protected assaults with Merkava tanks and Namer carriers, backed by precision missiles. Personal active protection stops one incoming missile every eight seconds; shells, aircraft and missile saturation remain dangerous."
END

GUI:BioFeatures_Israel
"Layered armour, vigilant sensors, protected crews, precision missiles"
END

OBJECT:Israel_SandCat
"SandCat"
END

CONTROLBAR:Israel_ConstructSandCat
"SandCat"
END

CONTROLBAR:Israel_DescriptionSandCat
"Fast scout with a machine gun and hidden-unit detection. Fragile against armour; no passengers."
END

OBJECT:Israel_Merkava
"Merkava"
END

CONTROLBAR:Israel_ConstructMerkava
"Merkava"
END

CONTROLBAR:Israel_DescriptionMerkava
"Heavy assault tank with personal active protection. Intercepts one small missile aimed at itself every eight seconds. Vulnerable to shells and missile saturation."
END

OBJECT:Israel_Namer
"Namer"
END

CONTROLBAR:Israel_ConstructNamer
"Namer"
END

CONTROLBAR:Israel_DescriptionNamer
"Heavy six-seat assault carrier with a machine gun and personal active protection. Quickly unloads infantry to fight; passengers cannot fire inside. One interception every eight seconds."
END

OBJECT:Israel_Pereh
"Pereh"
END

CONTROLBAR:Israel_ConstructPereh
"Pereh"
END

CONTROLBAR:Israel_DescriptionPereh
"Long-range precision missile tank hunter. High single-target damage, slow reload and a minimum range. Requires current friendly vision of the target. Needs an escort against infantry."
END

OBJECT:Israel_SPYDER
"SPYDER"
END

CONTROLBAR:Israel_ConstructSPYDER
"SPYDER"
END

CONTROLBAR:Israel_DescriptionSPYDER
"Responsive escort air defence. Fires a steady stream of missiles without deployment or a long salvo reload. Shorter reach than heavy air-defence batteries; cannot attack ground units."
END

OBJECT:Israel_PULS
"PULS"
END

CONTROLBAR:Israel_ConstructPULS
"PULS"
END

CONTROLBAR:Israel_DescriptionPULS
"Long-range rocket artillery fires four rockets per salvo. Fragile and vulnerable inside its minimum range; reloads for eight seconds."
END

OBJECT:Israel_D9
"Armoured D9"
END

CONTROLBAR:Israel_ConstructD9
"Armoured D9"
END

CONTROLBAR:Israel_DescriptionD9
"Armoured engineer vehicle. Builds, repairs and clears mines. Breaching Kits add health and protection from explosions so it can open mined routes under fire."
END

